1
00:00:01,847 --> 00:00:03,098
<font color="white">辛苦了</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:03,181 --> 00:00:04,641
<font color="white">-各位辛苦了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-辛苦了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:04,725 --> 00:00:05,767
<font color="white">辛苦囉</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:05,851 --> 00:00:08,603
<font color="white">玲奈，這下今天預定的行程都結束了</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:08,687 --> 00:00:10,355
<font color="white">-我去開車過來</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好</font></font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:12,441 --> 00:00:16,403
<font color="white">（爸）</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:17,654 --> 00:00:22,367
<font color="white">真是的，我平時明明總是叮嚀他</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">工作時沒辦法接電話</font></font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:23,368 --> 00:00:26,538
<font color="white">玲奈，我可能發現</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:00:26,621 --> 00:00:27,998
<font color="white">那起復興典禮事件的真相了</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:00:28,081 --> 00:00:30,459
<font color="white">超人力霸王的光正是關鍵</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:00:33,462 --> 00:00:35,046
<font color="white">-玲奈，快開電視！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什麼？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:36,465
<font color="white">動作快！</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:00:36,548 --> 00:00:37,966
<font color="white">（警察遭人刺傷？）</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:00:38,049 --> 00:00:39,760
<font color="white">在淡谷中央公園</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:00:39,843 --> 00:00:42,679
<font color="white">發生一名警察遭到襲擊的事件</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:00:43,263 --> 00:00:44,723
<font color="white">遇襲的警察</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:00:44,806 --> 00:00:46,850
<font color="white">是遠藤庸介警部補</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:00:46,933 --> 00:00:48,143
<font color="white">爸？</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:00:48,226 --> 00:00:50,645
<font color="white">他疑似遭到利刃攻擊</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:00:50,729 --> 00:00:53,356
<font color="white">目前身受重傷，陷入昏迷</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:00:54,274 --> 00:00:55,650
<font color="white">（遠藤庸介警部補）</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:00:55,734 --> 00:00:57,778
<font color="white">這個男人是…</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:02:29,161 --> 00:02:31,204
<font color="white">（嵯峨吉中央醫院）</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:02:45,135 --> 00:02:49,139
<font color="white">我來見父親的遠藤庸介</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">聽說他在這裡治療</font></font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:02:49,222 --> 00:02:50,765
<font color="white">稍等一下</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:02:51,766 --> 00:02:54,436
<font color="white">他應該被送來這裡了</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:02:55,437 --> 00:02:56,980
<font color="white">非常抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:02:57,063 --> 00:02:59,649
<font color="white">患者現在不開放探病</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:02:59,733 --> 00:03:01,318
<font color="white">家屬也不行嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:01,401 --> 00:03:03,486
<font color="white">是的，萬分抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:03,570 --> 00:03:06,907
<font color="white">-可是…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-妳是遠藤玲奈小姐對吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:08,992 --> 00:03:10,160
<font color="white">（遠藤庸介）</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:10,243 --> 00:03:11,369
<font color="white">（警察）</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:11,453 --> 00:03:13,163
<font color="white">雖然他還在昏迷中</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:13,246 --> 00:03:15,457
<font color="white">不過醫生說他沒有生命危險</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:17,792
<font color="white">那真是太好了</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:03:17,876 --> 00:03:22,130
<font color="white">遠藤先生說他調查的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">案情終於有點眉目了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:03:22,213 --> 00:03:24,758
<font color="white">然後就突然離開警察署</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:03:24,841 --> 00:03:26,426
<font color="white">後來…</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:03:26,509 --> 00:03:30,180
<font color="white">他就在那座公園被襲擊了對吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:03:31,431 --> 00:03:34,851
<font color="white">遠藤先生最近好像都在調查</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:03:34,935 --> 00:03:36,645
<font color="white">不是由他負責的案子</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:03:37,687 --> 00:03:40,023
<font color="white">難道他在查的是</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:03:40,106 --> 00:03:43,860
<font color="white">復興紀念典禮時的超人力霸王事件？</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:03:46,154 --> 00:03:47,364
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:03:50,909 --> 00:03:55,538
<font color="white">其實你明明就知道</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">超人力霸王不是壞人，對不對？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:03:56,248 --> 00:03:58,124
<font color="white">大家應該也是那麼認為的</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:03:58,208 --> 00:04:01,127
<font color="white">因為我當時說了那種話…</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:04:01,670 --> 00:04:05,131
<font color="white">妳有從遠藤先生那裡聽說</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:04:05,215 --> 00:04:07,425
<font color="white">關於超人力霸王事件的相關內容嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:04:08,176 --> 00:04:10,220
<font color="white">父親會被人攻擊</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:04:10,303 --> 00:04:12,514
<font color="white">跟那起事件有關嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:04:12,597 --> 00:04:14,224
<font color="white">這個嘛…</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:04:16,309 --> 00:04:19,396
<font color="white">這影片我其實還不能拿給妳看</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:04:19,980 --> 00:04:21,815
<font color="white">這是監視器拍下的畫面</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:04:23,483 --> 00:04:26,069
<font color="white">是超人力霸王攻擊我爸？</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:04:30,365 --> 00:04:33,994
<font color="white">如果妳能想起遠藤先生</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">最近有什麼特殊狀況</font></font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:04:34,077 --> 00:04:37,122
<font color="white">就算只是芝麻小事也行</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">可以告訴我嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:04:39,708 --> 00:04:43,211
<font color="white">我不太清楚</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:04:45,213 --> 00:04:46,631
<font color="white">是這樣啊</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:04:49,968 --> 00:04:52,095
<font color="white">關於積頓的夢？</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:04:52,178 --> 00:04:53,221
<font color="white">是的</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:04:53,805 --> 00:04:59,102
<font color="white">我的腦中最近不時會閃過</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">和積頓對峙的場景</font></font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:04:59,185 --> 00:05:01,313
<font color="white">也會夢到那樣的畫面</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:05:01,396 --> 00:05:04,691
<font color="white">那到底是怎麼回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:05:05,442 --> 00:05:07,193
<font color="white">我不知道</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:05:07,902 --> 00:05:10,864
<font color="white">但是當我開始做那些夢</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:05:11,573 --> 00:05:15,785
<font color="white">我就開始無法控制超人力霸王的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:05:15,869 --> 00:05:17,370
<font color="white">都在同一個時期發生</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:05:17,454 --> 00:05:19,998
<font color="white">我總覺得兩者之間存在某種關連性</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:05:20,081 --> 00:05:21,750
<font color="white">你想表達什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:05:21,833 --> 00:05:25,253
<font color="white">你認為早田以前跟積頓交手一事</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:05:25,337 --> 00:05:28,465
<font color="white">跟這次的事件有關嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:05:28,548 --> 00:05:30,258
<font color="white">雖然我也不清楚</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:05:30,341 --> 00:05:34,721
<font color="white">不過覺得那場戰鬥隱藏著某個關鍵</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:05:34,804 --> 00:05:36,681
<font color="white">這樣啊</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:05:37,223 --> 00:05:40,852
<font color="white">那麼你去一趟嵯峨吉町吧</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:05:40,935 --> 00:05:42,270
<font color="white">什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:05:43,813 --> 00:05:46,149
<font color="white">超人力霸王和積頓對戰時</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:05:46,232 --> 00:05:49,402
<font color="white">嵯峨吉町的災情特別慘重</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:05:49,903 --> 00:05:52,280
<font color="white">現在應該仍有事故受害者住在那裡</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:05:52,363 --> 00:05:54,365
<font color="white">你或許能得到什麼情報</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:06,294
<font color="white">太郎，你在做什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:06:06,377 --> 00:06:09,506
<font color="white">我打算從嵐先生</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">破壞的無人機位置情報</font></font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:06:09,589 --> 00:06:11,758
<font color="white">查出進次郎的所在地</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:06:12,967 --> 00:06:15,095
<font color="white">真是抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:06:15,178 --> 00:06:17,180
<font color="white">竟然要你追蹤夥伴的下落</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:06:17,263 --> 00:06:19,516
<font color="white">你心裡想必很不好受</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:06:19,599 --> 00:06:22,060
<font color="white">不要緊，這是我的任務</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:06:22,143 --> 00:06:25,105
<font color="white">再說我想見進次郎一面</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:06:25,188 --> 00:06:27,440
<font color="white">親自跟他確認</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:06:27,524 --> 00:06:29,067
<font color="white">那個時候發生的事…</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:06:31,736 --> 00:06:33,363
<font color="white">諸星先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:06:35,698 --> 00:06:39,953
<font color="white">“偶像的佐山玲奈跟那小子有來往</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:06:40,036 --> 00:06:42,747
<font color="white">調查一下她身邊的人”</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:06:43,248 --> 00:06:45,250
<font color="white">這是怎麼回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:06:51,548 --> 00:06:53,258
<font color="white">不論我等了多久</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:06:53,341 --> 00:06:56,261
<font color="white">他還是不聯絡我嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:06:59,472 --> 00:07:01,766
<font color="white">已經過兩小時了呢</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:07:02,809 --> 00:07:04,727
<font color="white">超人力霸王？</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:07:04,811 --> 00:07:08,940
<font color="white">啊，別這麼警戒，我是妳…</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:07:09,023 --> 00:07:12,402
<font color="white">是你攻擊了我爸，對吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:07:12,485 --> 00:07:13,862
<font color="white">是一場誤會</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:07:13,945 --> 00:07:15,113
<font color="white">那不是我</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:07:15,196 --> 00:07:16,865
<font color="white">不然會是誰？</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:07:16,948 --> 00:07:19,242
<font color="white">我認為大概是…</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:07:19,325 --> 00:07:21,995
<font color="white">-我想起來了！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-外表跟我長得很像的…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:07:22,078 --> 00:07:25,832
<font color="white">你以前也試圖</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">扮成超人力霸王賺錢吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:07:25,915 --> 00:07:27,625
<font color="white">不，那是因為…</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:07:27,709 --> 00:07:29,836
<font color="white">-父女都提到同樣的事</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-也就是說…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:07:29,919 --> 00:07:31,754
<font color="white">我知道了！</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:07:31,838 --> 00:07:32,797
<font color="white">妳知道了什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:07:32,881 --> 00:07:36,176
<font color="white">你是超人力霸王的冒牌貨吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:07:36,259 --> 00:07:37,594
<font color="white">什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:07:39,345 --> 00:07:40,805
<font color="white">真傷腦筋</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:07:40,889 --> 00:07:43,808
<font color="white">那麼看來我別無選擇了</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:07:49,022 --> 00:07:51,149
<font color="white">我是北斗星司</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:07:51,232 --> 00:07:53,818
<font color="white">幸會啊，遠藤玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:07:54,652 --> 00:07:56,654
<font color="white">很高興見到你</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:07:57,489 --> 00:07:59,824
<font color="white">你怎麼知道我的真名？</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:07:59,908 --> 00:08:01,784
<font color="white">我聽說了很多關於妳的事</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:08:01,868 --> 00:08:04,370
<font color="white">妳是早田學長的女友，對嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:08:04,454 --> 00:08:06,456
<font color="white">進次郎嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:08:06,539 --> 00:08:08,917
<font color="white">而且你還叫他“學長”？</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:12,212
<font color="white">我根本就沒有男朋友啦</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:08:12,295 --> 00:08:14,297
<font color="white">我是不是太多嘴了？</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:08:14,380 --> 00:08:18,051
<font color="white">總之有人交代我</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">如果妳父親出了意外</font></font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:08:18,134 --> 00:08:20,428
<font color="white">我必須幫助妳</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:08:20,512 --> 00:08:22,722
<font color="white">有人交代你要幫我？</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:08:22,805 --> 00:08:24,349
<font color="white">是誰說的啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:08:24,432 --> 00:08:25,892
<font color="white">-貝姆拉</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什麼？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:08:26,518 --> 00:08:28,853
<font color="white">別在意那種事了，我們走吧</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:08:28,937 --> 00:08:30,480
<font color="white">這裡很危險</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:08:30,563 --> 00:08:32,649
<font color="white">我們要去哪裡啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:08:34,359 --> 00:08:36,277
<font color="white">我的老家</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:08:39,447 --> 00:08:41,991
<font color="white">是啊，我記得很清楚</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:08:42,992 --> 00:08:46,120
<font color="white">超人力霸王和積頓戰鬥時</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:08:46,204 --> 00:08:49,666
<font color="white">這附近化為一片火海</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:08:50,166 --> 00:08:52,710
<font color="white">災情相當嚴重</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:08:52,794 --> 00:08:55,338
<font color="white">原來是這樣啊</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:08:55,421 --> 00:08:58,091
<font color="white">-當時吃了不少苦吧</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-是啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:08:58,591 --> 00:09:02,762
<font color="white">各位對超人力霸王抱持什麼想法？</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:09:02,845 --> 00:09:05,932
<font color="white">我們當然都很憤怒</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:09:06,015 --> 00:09:10,019
<font color="white">畢竟我們的家園瞬間遭到破壞</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:09:10,103 --> 00:09:11,854
<font color="white">因為那場戰鬥</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:09:11,938 --> 00:09:16,985
<font color="white">當時的居民幾乎都不住在這裡了</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:09:17,068 --> 00:09:20,613
<font color="white">他們被捲入超人力霸王的戰鬥</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">因而喪生了嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:09:20,697 --> 00:09:24,534
<font color="white">不，我記得當時無人死亡</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:09:25,118 --> 00:09:27,996
<font color="white">雖然有受傷的人被送醫</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:09:28,079 --> 00:09:32,458
<font color="white">每當遭逢那種狀況</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">早田都會去探望受害者</font></font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:09:33,042 --> 00:09:34,669
<font color="white">-請問一下…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什麼？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:09:34,752 --> 00:09:38,089
<font color="white">你知道傷患當時被送去哪間醫院嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:09:38,172 --> 00:09:42,927
<font color="white">我知道，就是那間嵯峨吉中央醫院</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:09:45,263 --> 00:09:47,640
<font color="white">-謝謝</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-不客氣</font></font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:09:56,733 --> 00:09:59,068
<font color="white">這裡是什麼地方？</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:09:59,152 --> 00:10:01,154
<font color="white">外星人街</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:10:01,237 --> 00:10:03,239
<font color="white">政府為了住在地球的外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:10:03,323 --> 00:10:06,200
<font color="white">特別準備的地區</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:10:06,784 --> 00:10:09,203
<font color="white">與外面的世界完美隔絕</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">隱藏得很隱密</font></font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:10:09,287 --> 00:10:11,623
<font color="white">經過精心設計，不會被一般人發現</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:10:12,957 --> 00:10:15,084
<font color="white">但是這些人看起來都…</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:10:15,168 --> 00:10:17,253
<font color="white">因為大家都擬態了</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:10:17,337 --> 00:10:19,005
<font color="white">他們其實都是外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:10:19,088 --> 00:10:20,798
<font color="white">啊，北斗哥哥！</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:10:21,924 --> 00:10:24,552
<font color="white">嗨，你過得好嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:10:24,636 --> 00:10:27,305
<font color="white">你暫時解除擬態吧</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:10:27,388 --> 00:10:28,806
<font color="white">什麼？可以解除嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:10:28,890 --> 00:10:30,516
<font color="white">-可以</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:10:32,935 --> 00:10:35,563
<font color="white">現在不用解除沒關係</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:10:36,230 --> 00:10:38,483
<font color="white">什麼？還真無趣</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:10:38,566 --> 00:10:39,984
<font color="white">拜拜！</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:10:40,068 --> 00:10:41,402
<font color="white">拜拜</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:10:41,486 --> 00:10:43,363
<font color="white">再見</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:10:43,446 --> 00:10:47,575
<font color="white">呃，你為什麼要帶我來外星人街？</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:10:49,243 --> 00:10:51,996
<font color="white">我是在這裡長大的</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:54,582
<font color="white">啊，我是地球人</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:10:54,666 --> 00:10:57,210
<font color="white">撫養我長大的就是外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:10:59,879 --> 00:11:01,798
<font color="white">啊，就是這裡</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:11:07,387 --> 00:11:08,554
<font color="white">怪了</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:11:08,638 --> 00:11:10,681
<font color="white">我明明說過今天要回來</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:11:10,765 --> 00:11:13,518
<font color="white">哇，那是什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:11:13,601 --> 00:11:15,103
<font color="white">等等，妳要去哪裡？</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:11:15,186 --> 00:11:16,854
<font color="white">玲奈小姐！</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:11:17,355 --> 00:11:19,482
<font color="white">大家乾杯吧！</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:11:19,565 --> 00:11:21,984
<font color="white">-好，乾杯！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-乾杯！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:11:29,575 --> 00:11:32,161
<font color="white">請問一下，這是什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:11:32,245 --> 00:11:34,539
<font color="white">那是盧比克星的能量飲料</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:11:34,622 --> 00:11:36,666
<font color="white">-很好喝喔</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-那我要買一個</font></font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:11:36,749 --> 00:11:39,252
<font color="white">-好啊！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-玲奈小姐，不要隨便亂跑</font></font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:11:39,335 --> 00:11:41,212
<font color="white">-那是什麼？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-等一下！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:11:41,295 --> 00:11:42,505
<font color="white">啊，對喔</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:11:42,588 --> 00:11:44,507
<font color="white">-叔叔，給你</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-謝謝</font></font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:11:44,590 --> 00:11:46,175
<font color="white">玲奈小姐，別亂跑！</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:11:46,259 --> 00:11:48,177
<font color="white">（外星人競技場</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">MMB錦標賽）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:11:48,261 --> 00:11:50,138
<font color="white">（格拉莫對上亞特蘭）</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:11:52,181 --> 00:11:53,266
<font color="white">哇</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:11:55,184 --> 00:11:57,728
<font color="white">真是的，玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:11:57,812 --> 00:11:59,605
<font color="white">這個看起來好有趣喔</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:11:59,689 --> 00:12:01,274
<font color="white">妳不能去看</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:12:01,357 --> 00:12:03,484
<font color="white">雖然這裡歸政府管理</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:12:03,568 --> 00:12:06,612
<font color="white">但是幾乎跟三不管地帶沒兩樣</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:12:06,696 --> 00:12:08,489
<font color="white">要是太引人注目…</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:12:08,573 --> 00:12:09,782
<font color="white">等一下！</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:12:12,618 --> 00:12:14,454
<font color="white">（嵯峨吉中央醫院）</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:12:14,537 --> 00:12:15,496
<font color="white">不好意思</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:12:15,580 --> 00:12:18,291
<font color="white">請問妳認識這個人嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:12:18,374 --> 00:12:22,753
<font color="white">我好像有看過他</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:12:22,837 --> 00:12:24,505
<font color="white">請問他是誰？</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:12:24,589 --> 00:12:26,591
<font color="white">我不太清楚</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:12:30,178 --> 00:12:34,390
<font color="white">我記得他好像是前外務大臣</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:12:34,474 --> 00:12:36,559
<font color="white">他是防衛大臣</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:12:36,642 --> 00:12:38,644
<font color="white">雖然已經是很久以前的事了</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:12:38,728 --> 00:12:41,647
<font color="white">你知道他曾來過這間醫院嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:12:42,648 --> 00:12:44,901
<font color="white">我不曉得耶</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:12:44,984 --> 00:12:47,820
<font color="white">我在這裡只工作了四年</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:12:47,904 --> 00:12:49,989
<font color="white">田中醫生</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:12:50,072 --> 00:12:52,241
<font color="white">請前往第二手術室</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:12:54,035 --> 00:12:55,745
<font color="white">我認識他喔</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:12:57,622 --> 00:12:59,707
<font color="white">你指的是早田先生吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:12:59,790 --> 00:13:02,084
<font color="white">就是那個科學特搜隊的人</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:13:07,048 --> 00:13:08,633
<font color="white">對不起嘛</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:13:08,716 --> 00:13:13,095
<font color="white">我第一次來這種地方，太興奮了</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:13:13,179 --> 00:13:14,555
<font color="white">妳是小孩子嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:13:15,139 --> 00:13:16,807
<font color="white">我說不定…</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:13:16,891 --> 00:13:19,018
<font color="white">還是小孩子</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:13:21,437 --> 00:13:25,441
<font color="white">我很小的時候媽媽就過世了</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:13:25,525 --> 00:13:27,568
<font color="white">我爸工作很忙</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:13:27,652 --> 00:13:29,862
<font color="white">我總是孤零零的</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:13:31,739 --> 00:13:34,534
<font color="white">我這樣很奇怪吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:13:34,617 --> 00:13:37,787
<font color="white">父親明明遇到嚴重的意外</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">我還表現得這樣</font></font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:13:53,636 --> 00:13:55,471
<font color="white">啊，對了</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:13:56,347 --> 00:13:57,807
<font color="white">這給妳吧</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:13:58,933 --> 00:14:00,226
<font color="white">這是什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:14:00,309 --> 00:14:03,104
<font color="white">貝姆拉要我轉交給妳父親</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:14:03,187 --> 00:14:05,356
<font color="white">我只知道這麼多</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:14:05,439 --> 00:14:09,735
<font color="white">這怎麼看都是頸鍊吧</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:14:10,319 --> 00:14:12,822
<font color="white">給妳保管吧</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:14:14,615 --> 00:14:16,993
<font color="white">尺寸對我來說剛剛好</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:14:17,076 --> 00:14:19,495
<font color="white">這好像不適合我爸</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:14:19,579 --> 00:14:21,330
<font color="white">怎麼樣啊？好看嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:14:21,414 --> 00:14:23,749
<font color="white">我覺得很適合妳</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:14:25,501 --> 00:14:29,046
<font color="white">對了，下面的洗手間有鏡子可以看</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:14:29,130 --> 00:14:30,298
<font color="white">好主意</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:14:30,381 --> 00:14:33,259
<font color="white">好，我去確認看看</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:14:39,515 --> 00:14:40,725
<font color="white">井手先生</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:14:40,808 --> 00:14:41,726
<font color="white">怎麼了？</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:14:41,809 --> 00:14:43,853
<font color="white">我調查了佐山玲奈這名偶像</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:14:43,936 --> 00:14:45,730
<font color="white">有什麼發現嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:14:45,813 --> 00:14:47,857
<font color="white">她的父親是…</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:14:48,441 --> 00:14:49,525
<font color="white">“警部補”？</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:14:49,609 --> 00:14:50,443
<font color="white">（遠藤庸介）</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:14:50,526 --> 00:14:51,611
<font color="white">嗯？</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:14:51,694 --> 00:14:54,030
<font color="white">他是昨天遇襲的警察吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:14:54,113 --> 00:14:56,866
<font color="white">對，但是不只那樣</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:14:57,408 --> 00:14:58,951
<font color="white">這是…</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:14:59,535 --> 00:15:02,204
<font color="white">這是我從不法途徑取得的照片</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:15:02,288 --> 00:15:04,373
<font color="white">這件超人力霸王裝甲…</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:15:04,457 --> 00:15:05,917
<font color="white">是北斗？</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:15:07,126 --> 00:15:09,587
<font color="white">他不可能做出這種事</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:15:10,963 --> 00:15:13,674
<font color="white">不過現在的問題是</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:15:13,758 --> 00:15:17,929
<font color="white">我們還沒有接收到這項資訊</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:15:18,471 --> 00:15:20,139
<font color="white">沒錯吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:15:20,222 --> 00:15:24,310
<font color="white">看來他們在提防科學特搜隊</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:15:24,393 --> 00:15:26,395
<font color="white">似乎是那樣</font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:15:27,021 --> 00:15:28,397
<font color="white">井手先生</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:15:28,481 --> 00:15:32,401
<font color="white">我打算去一趟</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">遠藤刑警接受治療的醫院</font></font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:15:32,902 --> 00:15:33,903
<font color="white">為什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:15:34,487 --> 00:15:39,158
<font color="white">我認為到那邊後，有機會遇到進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:15:45,456 --> 00:15:48,751
<font color="white">星星的碎片</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:15:51,253 --> 00:15:52,672
<font color="white">奇怪？</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:15:53,422 --> 00:15:55,633
<font color="white">這是怎麼回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:15:55,716 --> 00:15:57,718
<font color="white">頸鍊在發光</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:16:05,059 --> 00:16:06,560
<font color="white">怎麼了？</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:16:08,354 --> 00:16:13,526
<font color="white">早田先生來這裡</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">已經是將近二十年前的事了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:16:14,735 --> 00:16:16,404
<font color="white">對了，還有啊</font><font color="white"></font>

276
00:16:16,487 --> 00:16:19,907
<font color="white">超人力霸王最後在這一帶打鬥</font><font color="white"></font>

277
00:16:19,991 --> 00:16:22,827
<font color="white">我們當時收治許多遭受波及的傷患</font><font color="white"></font>

278
00:16:22,910 --> 00:16:25,579
<font color="white">早田先生怎麼會來這裡？</font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:16:26,914 --> 00:16:31,377
<font color="white">那場戰役結束後</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">外星人和怪獸不再來地球</font></font><font color="white"></font>

280
00:16:32,086 --> 00:16:34,797
<font color="white">在另一方面，那場戰鬥</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">卻釀成嚴重的災情</font></font><font color="white"></font>

281
00:16:36,173 --> 00:16:41,303
<font color="white">所以老實說大家對</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">科學特搜隊沒什麼好感</font></font><font color="white"></font>

282
00:16:43,597 --> 00:16:46,392
<font color="white">在那樣的狀況下，早田先生他啊</font><font color="white"></font>

283
00:16:46,475 --> 00:16:48,894
<font color="white">還到處去跟事故受害人低頭道歉</font><font color="white"></font>

284
00:16:48,978 --> 00:16:51,230
<font color="white">他甚至沒有搬出任何藉口</font><font color="white"></font>

285
00:16:51,814 --> 00:16:53,024
<font color="white">不只是那樣</font><font color="white"></font>

286
00:16:53,107 --> 00:16:55,943
<font color="white">那場戰鬥造成一名孕婦受傷</font><font color="white"></font>

287
00:16:56,027 --> 00:16:58,446
<font color="white">對方需要輸血時</font><font color="white"></font>

288
00:16:58,529 --> 00:17:01,365
<font color="white">早田先生第一個站出來捐血</font><font color="white"></font>

289
00:17:02,033 --> 00:17:05,745
<font color="white">那明明不是科學特搜隊的錯</font><font color="white"></font>

290
00:17:05,828 --> 00:17:09,790
<font color="white">當時我非常驚訝</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">他竟做到那種地步，讓我印象深刻</font></font><font color="white"></font>

291
00:17:10,708 --> 00:17:13,335
<font color="white">原來是那樣啊</font><font color="white"></font>

292
00:17:15,296 --> 00:17:18,549
<font color="white">若目小姐，波野醫生在找妳！</font><font color="white"></font>

293
00:17:18,632 --> 00:17:20,468
<font color="white">好！</font><font color="white"></font>

294
00:17:21,844 --> 00:17:26,098
<font color="white">那麼我該回去工作了</font><font color="white"></font>

295
00:17:26,724 --> 00:17:28,726
<font color="white">謝謝妳</font><font color="white"></font>

296
00:17:44,116 --> 00:17:46,744
<font color="white">到底是怎麼回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

297
00:17:46,827 --> 00:17:48,162
<font color="white">怎麼了？</font><font color="white"></font>

298
00:17:48,245 --> 00:17:50,372
<font color="white">妳沒事吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

299
00:17:50,456 --> 00:17:51,874
<font color="white">我沒事</font><font color="white"></font>

300
00:17:51,957 --> 00:17:55,753
<font color="white">話說你怎麼又變身成超人力霸王了？</font><font color="white"></font>

301
00:17:55,836 --> 00:17:58,672
<font color="white">這個嘛，妳想知道答案？</font><font color="white"></font>

302
00:18:02,343 --> 00:18:05,763
<font color="white">因為我有事情要問妳</font><font color="white"></font>

303
00:18:05,846 --> 00:18:09,183
<font color="white">告訴我超人力霸王在哪裡</font><font color="white"></font>

304
00:18:09,850 --> 00:18:14,063
<font color="white">我怎麼可能知道</font><font color="white"></font>

305
00:18:14,146 --> 00:18:15,439
<font color="white">玲奈小姐！</font><font color="white"></font>

306
00:18:15,523 --> 00:18:17,149
<font color="white">給我放開她！</font><font color="white"></font>

307
00:18:20,820 --> 00:18:21,946
<font color="white">玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

308
00:18:22,029 --> 00:18:23,447
<font color="white">那傢伙是冒牌貨</font><font color="white"></font>

309
00:18:23,531 --> 00:18:25,991
<font color="white">也是攻擊妳父親的犯人</font><font color="white"></font>

310
00:18:26,075 --> 00:18:27,201
<font color="white">攻擊我爸？</font><font color="white"></font>

311
00:18:27,284 --> 00:18:29,203
<font color="white">說得沒錯</font><font color="white"></font>

312
00:18:29,745 --> 00:18:33,415
<font color="white">你以為能把她藏匿在這裡嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

313
00:18:33,499 --> 00:18:35,126
<font color="white">但很遺憾</font><font color="white"></font>

314
00:18:35,209 --> 00:18:38,212
<font color="white">我也是外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

315
00:18:40,005 --> 00:18:44,176
<font color="white">我確實是有點大意了</font><font color="white"></font>

316
00:19:08,909 --> 00:19:10,119
<font color="white">玲奈小姐！</font><font color="white"></font>

317
00:19:18,127 --> 00:19:20,921
<font color="white">玲奈小姐，趁現在快逃！動作快！</font><font color="white"></font>

318
00:19:21,005 --> 00:19:22,089
<font color="white">好！</font><font color="white"></font>

319
00:19:42,401 --> 00:19:43,235
<font color="white">慘了！</font><font color="white"></font>

320
00:19:52,077 --> 00:19:53,204
<font color="white">北斗！</font><font color="white"></font>

321
00:19:53,287 --> 00:19:54,872
<font color="white">妳快逃</font><font color="white"></font>

322
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:01,837
<font color="white">可惡啊</font><font color="white"></font>

323
00:20:23,317 --> 00:20:25,694
<font color="white">妳在做什麼？快逃啊！</font><font color="white"></font>

324
00:20:25,778 --> 00:20:27,029
<font color="white">北斗！</font><font color="white"></font>

325
00:20:27,738 --> 00:20:29,365
<font color="white">不要擔心</font><font color="white"></font>

326
00:20:29,448 --> 00:20:31,367
<font color="white">我不是來找這傢伙的</font><font color="white"></font>

327
00:20:31,450 --> 00:20:35,621
<font color="white">為了防止他阻礙我</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">我只是讓他吃點苦頭</font></font><font color="white"></font>

328
00:20:39,667 --> 00:20:42,336
<font color="white">哎呀，你要回去了嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

329
00:20:43,003 --> 00:20:44,171
<font color="white">是的</font><font color="white"></font>

330
00:20:45,381 --> 00:20:47,841
<font color="white">請問一下，我爸…</font><font color="white"></font>

331
00:20:48,509 --> 00:20:51,637
<font color="white">早田先生什麼時候</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">才不再拜訪這間醫院？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

332
00:20:52,221 --> 00:20:54,974
<font color="white">直到所有受害的傷患都出院為止</font><font color="white"></font>

333
00:20:55,683 --> 00:20:57,518
<font color="white">剛剛提到的孕婦…</font><font color="white"></font>

334
00:20:57,601 --> 00:20:59,103
<font color="white">這個嘛…</font><font color="white"></font>

335
00:20:59,186 --> 00:21:02,314
<font color="white">那個人的身體狀況最後沒有好轉</font><font color="white"></font>

336
00:21:02,982 --> 00:21:07,403
<font color="white">但她生下了健康的女嬰</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">可以說是不幸中的大幸</font></font><font color="white"></font>

337
00:21:07,486 --> 00:21:08,570
<font color="white">什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

338
00:21:10,614 --> 00:21:13,951
<font color="white">母親生下我後隨即逝世</font><font color="white"></font>

339
00:21:14,702 --> 00:21:18,122
<font color="white">她被超人力霸王和外星人的戰鬥波及</font><font color="white"></font>

340
00:21:19,039 --> 00:21:21,959
<font color="white">受困在倒塌的醫院…</font><font color="white"></font>

341
00:21:22,543 --> 00:21:24,003
<font color="white">身亡</font><font color="white"></font>

342
00:21:24,586 --> 00:21:26,839
<font color="white">難道說…</font><font color="white"></font>

343
00:21:26,922 --> 00:21:29,591
<font color="white">爸救的人是…</font><font color="white"></font>

344
00:21:31,552 --> 00:21:33,137
<font color="white">玲奈小姐？</font><font color="white"></font>

345
00:24:05,080 --> 00:24:08,167
<font color="white">字幕翻譯：劉哲琪</font><font color="white"></font>

